#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Most weapons have a secondary fire mode (Right Click) — the shotgun's double-barrel blast is devastating."
msgstr "ほとんどの武器にはセカンダリ射撃モード(右クリック)があり、ショットガンのダブルバレルの一撃は強烈です。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:40
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "マウス"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake_shareware.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Mouselook is enabled by default — aim up and down to hit enemies on different elevations."
msgstr "マウスルックはデフォルトで有効です。高さの異なる場所にいる敵に当てるには、上下に狙いを定めましょう。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:82
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:24
